Z||000000||speed racer||06-22-2000||09:49 PM||||what kind of wheel cleaner have you found that does the best job||||reg||1
Z||000001||Rodney||06-22-2000||10:47 PM||||P21s. There is no second place. I'm on the Ferrari mailing list. It is all the Ferrari owners use. Made in Germany. I use it on my rims. Also on the engine and other things. Brake calipers on my motorcycle. Cleans excellent but will not hurt painted surfaces for the most part. <P>Rodney Dickman  1988 Mera  308 replica||||reg||1
